                "<p><strong>Once per Turn Action</strong> — <img src='https://legendstory-production-s3-public.s3.amazonaws.com/static/images/card-icons/icon_cost.webp' alt='{r}'><img src='https://legendstory-production-s3-public.s3.amazonaws.com/static/images/card-icons/icon_cost.webp' alt='{r}'>: If an Earth card is pitched this way, your attacks named Mangle get +2<img src='https://legendstory-production-s3-public.s3.amazonaws.com/static/images/card-icons/icon_pwr.webp' alt='{p}'> this turn. If an Ice card is pitched this way, your attacks named Mangle get <strong>dominate</strong> this turn. <strong>Go again</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Temper</strong> <em>(When the combat chain closes, if this defended, put a -1<img src='https://legendstory-production-s3-public.s3.amazonaws.com/static/images/card-icons/icon_def.webp' alt='{d}'> counter on it, then if it has 0<img src='https://legendstory-production-s3-public.s3.amazonaws.com/static/images/card-icons/icon_def.webp' alt='{d}'>, destroy it.)</em></p>\n"
